body:
@braids I think you aren't understanding. Let me be very clear: we have no intention to revert the new theme. Instead, we will listen to feedback from users who are unhappy with it and implement changes to the _new_ theme in response to that feedback. 

If your only suggestion is "revert the new theme" then you are going to be ignored. The only way we would revert the new theme is if way more people disliked it than people who like it, and you can see from the original PR that 10x as many people prefer the new theme than people who dislike it. 

Understanding that you have valid criticisms of the new theme, we would like to improve it. But if your only suggestion is "revert the PR or nothing" then unfortunately, we will do nothing.

@braids I am fully with your proposal regarding this change.
Even Battlefield did not bother to change the Godot Theme.
Apparently, there was nothing wrong with it
